  // fract(noise\xB79.7 + t\xB7speed) thresholded near 1 \u2192 a guaranteed ~13% of
  // cells lit at any instant, each flaring for ~a quarter second then
  // cutting out, scattered along the ribbon (path-pinned cells, ~8px at
